00:26:37.950 --> 00:26:42.850
Preview of Next Episode

00:26:38.780 --> 00:26:42.040
Despite the massive gap in numbers,
the Alliance held off the Imperial troops.

00:26:42.040 --> 00:26:46.390
As Schenkopp had hoped,
the Alliance 5th Fleet arrived.

00:26:46.390 --> 00:26:51.150
But at the same time, they also ran the
risk of bringing in more Imperial fleets.

00:26:51.150 --> 00:26:52.950
This small battle on a remote satellite...

00:26:52.950 --> 00:26:58.020
